## Register feature

this file defines the register feature

Users will be able to register
it should require name, email, phone and password
all fields are required
the layout is located at `layout-images\register.png`
it should post all data
the api endponint is '/api/users/register'
after registering the user should see a toast with the server message
if request fails or there any missing info user should see a red toast
